    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "sure, but that \"fleeting intensity\" feels more like just suffering through the clock until it stops. if nothing matters in the long run, then the struggle to keep going just feels like an extra, unnecessary layer of pain. why is it better to keep struggling when the end result is the same?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
